    "updated_at": "2016-11-23T15:51:21Z",
    "body": "@bzbarsky I hope you're not suggesting that MIT is a sufficient population to keep the feature alive :)  They have enough smart folks around that they should be able to figure out an alternative solution.\r\n\r\nWe've been talking about this for ages, and there's been no mass protest so far.  So I'm A-OK with proceeding with removal, shouting it from the rooftops, and if there's outcry in response, we can pull back.",
